{"id": "rc-zilina-rfc-oxford-2023", "source": "archiv", "date": "2023-04-09T19:13:34", "title": "Muži: RC Žilina 30 : 65 RFC Oxford (2023)", "excerpt": "Európsky zápas proti Oxfordu – prehra, ale výrazne lepší výkon a skvelá atmosféra.", "thumb": "assets/archive/rc-zilina-rfc-oxford-2023/082.jpg", "category": "muzi", "html": "<div class=\"wp-block-group has-background\" style=\"background-color:#e3ebe4;padding-top:20px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:20px;padding-left:24px\">\n<p><strong>Kedy:</strong> apríl 2023<br><strong>Súper:</strong> RFC Oxford (UK)<br><strong>Výsledok:</strong> Žilina 30 : 65 Oxford</p>\n</div>\n\n<p>ENG</p>\n\n<p>european matches - Zilina against Oxford UK<br>Great spirit and graet rugny match.<br>We have improved the level since the matches in Ruda, against Ruda and Olomouc.<br>Great atmosphere after the match as well.<br>Our performances improved a lot, we have played 2 matches XV within a month. After 3 years without playing a XV match. We make history</p>\n\n<p>SK<br>európske zápasy - Žilina proti Oxfordu UK<br>Skvelý duch a skvelý rugny zápas.<br>Od zápasov v Rude, proti Rude a Olomoucu sme zlepšili úroveň.<br>Výborná atmosféra aj po zápase.<br>Naše výkony sa veľmi zlepšili, v priebehu mesiaca sme odohrali 2 zápasy XV. Po 3 rokoch bez odohrania zápasu XV. Tvoríme históriu</p>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Fotky</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"assets/archive/rc-zilina-rfc-oxford-2023/001.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"assets/archive/rc-zilina-rfc-oxford-2023/002.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"assets/archive/rc-zilina-rfc-oxford-2023/003.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"assets/archive/rc-zilina-rfc-oxford-2023/004.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"assets/archive/rc-zilina-rfc-oxford-2023/005.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"assets/archive/rc-zilina-rfc-oxford-2023/006.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"assets/archive/rc-zilina-rfc-oxford-2023/007.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"assets/archive/rc-zilina-rfc-oxford-2023/008.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"assets/archive/rc-zilina-rfc-oxford-2023/009.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n\n<details class=\"wp-block-details\"><summary>Zobraziť všetky fotky (81)</summary>\n<a href=\"assets/archive/rc-zilina-rfc-oxford-2023/001.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/archive/rc-zilina-rfc-oxford-2023/001.jpg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;margin-bottom:8px\"></a><a href=\"assets/archive/rc-zilina-rfc-oxford-2023/010.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/archive/rc-zilina-rfc-oxford-2023/010.jpg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;margin-bottom:8px\"></a><a href=\"assets/archive/rc-zilina-rfc-oxford-2023/011.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/archive/rc-zilina-rfc-oxford-2023/011.jpg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;margin-bottom:8px\"></a><a href=\"assets/archive/rc-zilina-rfc-oxford-2023/012.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/archive/rc-zilina-rfc-oxford-2023/012.jpg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;margin-bottom:8px\"></a><a href=\"assets/archive/rc-zilina-rfc-oxford-2023/013.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/archive/rc-zilina-rfc-oxford-2023/013.jpg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;margin-bottom:8px\"></a><a href=\"assets/archive/rc-zilina-rfc-oxford-2023/014.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/archive/rc-zilina-rfc-oxford-2023/014.jpg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;margin-bottom:8px\"></a><a href=\"assets/archive/rc-zilina-rfc-oxford-2023/015.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/archive/rc-zilina-rfc-oxford-2023/015.jpg\" alt=\"\" style=\"widt